 "originality_note": "Every melody, harmony and arrangement here was written for this film. Phrases such as Ni Re Ga or Pa Ma Ga Re are the grammar of Raga Yaman Kalyan, not quotations; the seed, mukhda, violin answer, bride and groom variants and their rhythms are new. The descending-bass progression and the bVI-bVII-I lift are common practice. Nothing is copied, imitated or paraphrased from any film or wedding song."
}